<?xml version="1.0"?>
<Guide xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <Splits>
    <Split>
      <Name>Tutorial</Name>
      <Note />
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Meadow Zone</Name>
      <Note>* **Bulbasaur's Daring Dash** - Use Pikachu

- Talk to Treecko on bridge
- **Munchlax** (Big Berry)
- **Turtwig**
- **Pachirisu**

* **Bulbasaur's Daring Dash** - Use Turtwig

- **Mankey**
- **Oddish**

* Talk to Croagunk, enter gate
* Talk to Venusar and leave

- Towards Obstacle Hop
  - Fast **Treecko**
  - **Spearow**
  - **Treecko** if not earlier
- **Croagunk**

* **Vensaur's Vine Swing** - Use Mankey
* Go to Meeting Place</Note>
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Meeting Place</Name>
      <Note># Meeting Place

- After Chikorita, talk to Drifblim
- Run around, talk to Misdreavus
  - Take a picture, talk again
- Talk to Electabuzz
- Talk to Corphish
</Note>
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Beach Zone</Name>
      <Note># Beach Zone

- **Psyduck** or **Buizel** immediately
- Get 6 of the following at some point (need 100 berries):
  * **Azurill** (20)
  * **Pidgeotto** (20)
  * **Staravia** (20)
  * **Starly** (10)
  * **Totodile** (20)
  * Slowpoke (10)
  * Mudkip [in Iceberg] (10)
  * Taillow (20)
  * Wingull (20)
  * Bibarel (30)
  * Piloswine [iceberg] (20)

* Corsola quiz
* TALK TO FERALIGATR
* **Golduck** or **Floatzel**

- Take Drifblim to Meadow Zone

# Meadow Zone
* Bidoof lumber
* **Chimchar**

- Talk to Bidoof after Bibarel shows up
- Back to Beach Zone

# Beach Zone
* Get wood left of bridge and bring it to Bidoof
* Pelipper game

- 2 More wood for Bidoof
- Gyarados - Use Golduck
- Fight Feraligatr
- Lapras</Note>
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Iceberg Zone</Name>
      <Note>- Go mid all the way to Piloswine
  - If got Slowpoke, get **Mudkip** if on the way (unless at 8 already)
- Turn around, go right path
- Get 3 Ice Blocks for Glalie
  - Back wall (to activate cutscene and give)
  - Right
  - Left

* **Teddiursa** (chase or quiz)
* **Ursaring**

- Take middle path towards ice tree
  - **Prinplup**
- Take chairlift, talk to **Froslass**

* **Quagsire** (Big Berry crate)
* **Octillery**
* Chairlift back up, go to Glalie

- Talk to Frosslass
- **Glalie**
- **Mamoswine**
- Empoleon - Use Glalie
  - 1370-1375 berries after minigame
  - Backups:
    - 10 = crate by Drifblim
    - 20 = Piloswine
- Take Drifblim to Meeting Place</Note>
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Burmy + Dash</Name>
      <Note># Meeting Place
* Optional: Go up treehouse to get **Burmy** on the second floor

| "Optional" Friends | Burmy |
|-|-|
| 5 | Required |
| 6 | Skip = All 4 optionals + Bonsly + Sudowoodo |
|    | Get = 3 wandering optionals + Bonsly + Sudowoodo |
| 7 | Skip = 3 optionals + Bonsly + Sudowoodo |
|    | Get = 4 optionals or 2 + Bonsly + Sudowoodo |
| 8 | Skip = 4 optionals or 2 + Bonsly + Sudowoodo |
|    | Get = 3 optionals or 1 + Bonsly + Sudowoodo |

* Ponyta upgrade Dash twice
* Cavern Zone (Cranidos)
</Note>
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Cavern Zone</Name>
      <Note># Cavern Zone
* Mr. Mime
* Towards Mawile
* Immediate left
  * _Meowth or Geodude (wandering, Meowth first if both)_
* Curve right past Bastiodon
* _Bonsly + Sudowoodo before tunnel to Cranidos_
* **Aron**
* **Mawile** chase
* Turn around for **Dugtrio**
* Break crate with **Magnemite** inside (dash up+left after dugtrio)

- Take the far back path around
  - **Magnemite**
  - **Cranidos**
    - Can replace with **Scizor** IF you have Meowth, Geodude, Bonsly AND Sudowoodo
- **Marowak**
- Diglett in right crate
- big berry in left crate
  - bring berry towards snorlax, fall off ramp to drop it
  - thunderbolt snorlax, give berry
- Bring rail to Mr Mime
  - Activate Drifblim on the way

* **Gible**
* Run through and around towards Bastiodon
  * **Drifblim** (do not take, just talk)
  * **Diglett**
  * _Raichu and/or Torchic if needed_
* **Bastiodon's Block Barrage** - Use Pikachu or Sudowoodo (4k)
  * Need 50 total friends

- Talk to **Dugtrio**
- Minecart to Lava Zone</Note>
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Lava Zone</Name>
      <Note>* Go down hill to Camerupt
* **Hitmontop**

- Get iron from drill -&gt; Straight
- **Golem**
- Get iron from drill -&gt; Round
- Rhyperior - Use Pikachu (6k)

* Charmander on spiral path
* Meditite quiz
* Farfetch'd

- Blaziken - Use Pikachu (5-5.9k)
- Dash down+left after minigame
- Save &amp; Quit after leaving Blaziken's room
- Drifblim -&gt; Meeting Place</Note>
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Haunted Zone</Name>
      <Note># Meeting Place
* Ponyta -&gt; Double Dash
* Mime Jr. + Burmy
* Duskull

# Haunted Zone
- Tangrowth - Use Raichu or Pikachu
- Talk to Drifloon, enter mansion

* Follow Duskull
* Follow Gastly
  * Chase **Gastly** (if Burmy was before Cavern Zone)
* Gengar cutscene in next room
* Dusknoir - Use Cranidos / Scizor

- Turn around and talk to Dusknull
- Go to Piano
- Talk to Misdreavus

* Go back to entrance room, take stairs up to Gastly
* **Abra**
* Talk to Spinarak
  * Bring string to piano

- Library, talk to Duskull
- Sableye quiz
- Put book on shelf
- Rotom - Use Abra (5k)

* **Electrode** if he's in your way out of the mansion
  * Run upstairs to **Spinarak** otherwise
* **Drifloon**
* **Kakuna** and **Metapod** in trees outside

- Leave</Note>
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Granite Zone</Name>
      <Note># Meeting place
* Climb treehouse and talk to Mime Jr.
* Talk to Skorupi and enter Granite Zone

# Granite Zone
* **Lopunny**
* Absol -&gt; Use Lopunny
* Hit switch to rotate bridge
  * Cross bridge and HIT SWITCH AGAIN

- Run up ramp, talk to Flygon
- Fight **Blastoise**

* Take ramps, do not talk to Skorupi, platform and hit switch
* Fall off platform, go through doorway on right, go right and down to Porygon-Z

- Go back and talk to Skorupi
- Go up to Bronzor, fight Electivire
- Hit switch
- Take zipline to Togekiss
- Do Togekiss and zipline back
- **Skorupi** on the way back

* Drifblim back by Flygon

# Cavern Zone
* Talk to Mawile
* Talk to Snorlax
* Take Drifblim

# Granite Zone
* Talk to Flygon
* Salamence -&gt; Use Togekiss
  * 80 friend gate
* Go to Flower Zone</Note>
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Flower Zone</Name>
      <Note># Flower Zone

* Talk to Bellossom
* Talk to Shaymin
* Drifblim -&gt; Meeting Place

# Meeting Place
* Climb to the top of the tree, grab mirror

# Flower Zone
* Place mirror
* Rayquaza - Use Pikachu
* Talk to Shaymin
* Talk to Bellossom
* Water flower</Note>
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Mew</Name>
      <Note />
    </Split>
  </Splits>
  <Name>PokéPark Wii: Pikachu's Adventure</Name>
  <Category>Any%</Category>
</Guide>